  era: "Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Chalcolithic Age
  text: "The Chalcolithic, or Copper\u2013Stone Age, saw farming villages begin to use copper alongside stone. In different regions it ran from about 3000 to 700 BCE, and many of these cultures flourished outside or after the Harappan cities."
